            0.054,
            0.013,
            0.953,
            0.2
          ],
          "content": "In-class participation **Grading, cont. Previously, 5% part regular grade. Impossible to manage with this size class.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.052,
            0.259,
            0.956,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": "**New: Extra credit option. 5% max. (Experiment / subject to change.)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.053,
            0.393,
            0.796,
            0.448
          ],
          "content": "**Required minimum to get (partial) extra credit:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.108,
            0.473,
            0.837,
            0.76
          ],
          "content": "**7 in-class participation events (in-class question/comment/remark, answer to in-class question, hwk suggestion, help with progr. assign. prep., topic suggestion, news item suggestion)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.051,
            0.784,
            0.968,
            0.996
          ],
          "content": "**Reporting: Honor system. Keep track yourself (use google doc). I will ask for an interim report during the term and a final report. Email to:** <strong><u>bart.selman@gmail.com</u></strong> **Include your full name & netid.**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "page_idx": 4,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.685,
            0.025,
