          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Admin details"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.069,
            0.09,
            0.959,
            0.195
          ],
          "content": "**This is a large course. That’s why there is much less flexibility than in a small or mid-size course.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.073,
            0.217,
            0.891,
            0.378
          ],
          "content": "**Before signing up, make sure that --- you can attend the midterm (don’t schedule interview travel for that date). There is no make-up.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.073,
            0.429,
            0.919,
            0.537
          ],
          "content": "**--- you can attend the final exam (don’t travel home before the final.) There is no make-up.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.073,
            0.588,
            0.863,
            0.698
          ],
          "content": "**--- late days on homework are there to give you needed flexibility. Use them wisely.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.076,
            0.757,
            0.955,
            0.865
          ],
          "content": "**If you cannot attend midterm or exam, do not sign up for the course! (Otherwise need to withdraw later.)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.086,
            0.901,
            0.844,
            0.955
          ],
          "content": "**Exams date & time: See University schedule on web.**"
        }
      ]
    },
